{"id":"2a8759d3e1558bf3","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-arithmetic-function.md","title":"Arithmetic Function","display":"df-arithmetic-function — Arithmetic Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-arithmetic-function","aliases":["58-df-arithmetic-function","Arithmetic Function"],"display":"df-arithmetic-function — Arithmetic Function","depends_on":["[[58-df-number-theory]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-arithmetic-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-arithmetic-function</span><span>Arithmetic Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-function — Arithmetic Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"92b2961f9d6bbcaa\" href=\"?note=92b2961f9d6bbcaa\" title=\"58-df-number-theory\">58-df-number-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\mathbb{N}_{&gt;0}\\to\\mathbb{C}\">\\(f,g:\\mathbb{N}_{&gt;0}\\to\\mathbb{C}\\)</span> (arithmetic functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ArithFunc}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ArithFunc}_S\\)</span> (arithmetic-function predicate defined in this file)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Multiplicative}\">\\(\\operatorname{Multiplicative}\\)</span> (multiplicativity predicate defined in this file)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompletelyMultiplicative}\">\\(\\operatorname{CompletelyMultiplicative}\\)</span> (complete-multiplicativity predicate defined in this file)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic-function} \\vdash \\operatorname{ArithFunc}_S(f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb{N}_{&gt;0},\\mathbb{C})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic-function} \\vdash \\operatorname{ArithFunc}_S(f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb{N}_{&gt;0},\\mathbb{C})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multiplicative-arithmetic-function} \\vdash \\operatorname{Multiplicative}(f) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ArithFunc}_S(f)\\land f(1)=1\\land\\forall m,n \\in \\mathbb{N}_{&gt;0}\\;(\\gcd(m,n) = 1 \\to f(mn) = f(m)f(n))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multiplicative-arithmetic-function} \\vdash \\operatorname{Multiplicative}(f) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ArithFunc}_S(f)\\land f(1)=1\\land\\forall m,n \\in \\mathbb{N}_{&gt;0}\\;(\\gcd(m,n) = 1 \\to f(mn) = f(m)f(n))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completely-multiplicative-arithmetic-function} \\vdash \\operatorname{CompletelyMultiplicative}(f) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ArithFunc}_S(f)\\land f(1)=1\\land\\forall m,n \\in \\mathbb{N}_{&gt;0}\\;(f(mn) = f(m)f(n))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completely-multiplicative-arithmetic-function} \\vdash \\operatorname{CompletelyMultiplicative}(f) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ArithFunc}_S(f)\\land f(1)=1\\land\\forall m,n \\in \\mathbb{N}_{&gt;0}\\;(f(mn) = f(m)f(n))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Arithmetic function: a function on the positive integers; convolution is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5db9165df9c4fdf9\" href=\"?note=5db9165df9c4fdf9\" title=\"58-df-dirichlet-convolution\">58-df-dirichlet-convolution</a>.</li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi, d(n), \\sigma(n), \\mu(n)\">\\(\\phi, d(n), \\sigma(n), \\mu(n)\\)</span> are multiplicative; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu * 1 = \\epsilon\">\\(\\mu * 1 = \\epsilon\\)</span></li>\n<li>Multiplicative: determined by values at prime powers via Euler product</li>\n<li>Möbius inversion: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(n) = \\sum_{d|n} f(d) \\iff f(n) = \\sum_{d|n} \\mu(d) g(n/d)\">\\(g(n) = \\sum_{d|n} f(d) \\iff f(n) = \\sum_{d|n} \\mu(d) g(n/d)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Apostol, Introduction to Analytic Number Theory</li>\n<li>Hardy and Wright, An Introduction to the Theory of Numbers</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-number-theory","status":"resolved","id":"92b2961f9d6bbcaa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-number-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f,g:\\mathbb{N}_{>0}\\to\\mathbb{C}$ (arithmetic functions, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-dirichlet-convolution","status":"resolved","id":"5db9165df9c4fdf9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Arithmetic function: a function on the positive integers; convolution is defined in [[58-df-dirichlet-convolution]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,g:\\mathbb{N}_{>0}\\to\\mathbb{C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ArithFunc}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Multiplicative}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CompletelyMultiplicative}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic-function} \\vdash \\operatorname{ArithFunc}_S(f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb{N}_{>0},\\mathbb{C})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multiplicative-arithmetic-function} \\vdash \\operatorname{Multiplicative}(f) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ArithFunc}_S(f)\\land f(1)=1\\land\\forall m,n \\in \\mathbb{N}_{>0}\\;(\\gcd(m,n) = 1 \\to f(mn) = f(m)f(n))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completely-multiplicative-arithmetic-function} \\vdash \\operatorname{CompletelyMultiplicative}(f) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ArithFunc}_S(f)\\land f(1)=1\\land\\forall m,n \\in \\mathbb{N}_{>0}\\;(f(mn) = f(m)f(n))","display":true},{"tex":"\\phi, d(n), \\sigma(n), \\mu(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu * 1 = \\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"g(n) = \\sum_{d|n} f(d) \\iff f(n) = \\sum_{d|n} \\mu(d) g(n/d)","display":false}],"bytes":1833,"backlinks":[{"id":"804e9900d6a09ca9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5db9165df9c4fdf9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-arithmetic-function.md|58-df-arithmetic-function]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["92b2961f9d6bbcaa",